# 선형성

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>측정값 예측 계산기</title>
<style>
body { font-family: sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 20px; background-color: #f4f7f6; }
.card { background: white; padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); width: 100%; max-width: 400px; }
h2 { text-align: center; color: #333; font-size: 1.2rem; }
.input-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }
label { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; }
input { width: 100%; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 6px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 1rem; }
.result-box { margin-top: 20px; padding: 15px; background-color: #e8f5e9; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; }
.result-label { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #2e7d32; margin-bottom: 5px; }
.result-value { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: bold; color: #1b5e20; }
hr { border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 20px 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
<h2>측정값 예측 (보간법)</h2>